<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Catalina Marketing.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Catalina Marketing.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it initiated coverage of Catalina Marketing Corp as an accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Catalina Marketing gained two to 53-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
